      "code": "def build_agent(sandbox):\n    # Create horizontal beam at (20,8) with width 2m and height 1m\n    horizontal_beam = sandbox.add_beam(x=20, y=8, width=2, height=1, density=1.0)\n    \n    # Create vertical beam 1 at (18,8) with width 0.5m and height 1m\n    vertical_beam1 = sandbox.add_beam(x=18, y=8, width=0.5, height=1, density=1.0)\n    # Anchor vertical_beam1 to the floor at (18,0)\n    joint1 = sandbox.add_joint(vertical_beam1, None, (18, 0), type='rigid')\n    \n    # Create vertical beam 2 at (22,8) with width 0.5m and height 1m\n    vertical_beam2 = sandbox.add_beam(x=22, y=8, width=0.5, height=1, density=1.0)\n    # Anchor vertical_beam2 to the floor at (22,0)\n    joint2 = sandbox.add_joint(vertical_beam2, None, (22, 0), type='rigid')\n    \n    # Connect horizontal beam to vertical_beam1 at (18,8)\n    joint3 = sandbox.add_joint(horizontal_beam, vertical_beam1, (18, 8), type='rigid')\n    # Connect horizontal beam to vertical_beam2 at (22,8)\n    joint4 = sandbox.add_joint(horizontal_beam, vertical_beam2, (22, 8), type='rigid')\n    \n    return horizontal_beam\n\ndef agent_action(sandbox, agent_body, step_count):\n    # No action needed for a static, anchored structure\n    pass",
